---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead title={"2. Liminal Spaces & Modern Isolation | " + SITE_TITLE} description="2. Liminal Spaces & Modern Isolation category page" />
        <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the Backrooms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A fictional liminal dimension\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is liminality scary?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Lack of context/purpose\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it a creepypasta?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, originating on 4chan\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Real-life liminal spaces?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Empty airports, hotels\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why popular now?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Reflects modern isolation\"}}]}"} />
            <style>
	.dossier-case-page {
		width: 75%;
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 20px;
		font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
	}
	.dossier-case-header {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--accent, #B91C1C);
		padding-left: 1em;
	}
	.dossier-case-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		background: var(--accent-dark, #7A1212);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 0.68em;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		padding: 0.3em 0.8em;
		margin-bottom: 0.6em;
	}
	.dossier-case-summary {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #D6D3CE;
	}
	.dossier-keywords {
		margin: 40px 0;
		padding: 1.5em 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(185,28,28,0.25);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(185,28,28,0.25);
	}
	.dossier-keywords h3 {
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		font-size: 0.8em;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		color: var(--accent, #B91C1C);
		font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
	}
	.dossier-keyword-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.7em;
	}
	.dossier-keyword-tag {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5em;
		padding: 0.6em 1em;
		background: #1A1816;
		color: #D6D3CE;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.85em;
		border: 1px solid rgba(185,28,28,0.3);
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.dossier-keyword-tag:hover {
		border-color: var(--accent, #B91C1C);
		color: var(--accent, #B91C1C);
	}
	.dossier-keyword-tag .redaction {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 10px;
		height: 8px;
		background: var(--accent-dark, #7A1212);
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.dossier-keyword-tag.is-pending {
		color: #6b6862;
		border-color: rgba(232,226,213,0.12);
		cursor: not-allowed;
	}
	.dossier-keyword-tag.is-pending .redaction {
		background: #3a3733;
	}

	.dossier-faq {
		margin-top: 60px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(185,28,28,0.3);
		background: #1A1816;
	}
	.dossier-faq-title {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 1.2em;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1.5em;
		font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
		color: #D6D3CE;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(185,28,28,0.3);
	}
	.dossier-faq-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}
	.dossier-faq-item {
		padding: 1.5em 1.8em;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(185,28,28,0.2);
	}
	.dossier-faq-item:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}
	.dossier-faq-q {
		display: block;
		font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
		font-size: 1.05em;
		color: var(--accent, #B91C1C);
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
	.dossier-faq-a {
		margin: 0;
		color: #D6D3CE;
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 0.95em;
	}
	.dossier-faq-a strong {
		color: #8a8680;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	@media (max-width: 780px) {
		.dossier-case-page {
			width: 100%;
			padding: 16px;
		}
	}
</style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <main class="dossier-case-page">
        <header class="dossier-case-header">
            <span class="dossier-case-tag">CASE FILE</span>
            <h1>2. Liminal Spaces & Modern Isolation</h1>
        </header>

        <section class="dossier-case-summary">
            <p>The modern era has birthed "Liminal Space" legends, most notably "The Backrooms." These tales focus on the unease felt in transitional, empty places like abandoned malls or endless hallways. This dimension explores the "Uncanny Valley" of architecture, where familiar environments become alien and hostile. It reflects a modern existential dread—the fear of being "clipped" out of reality and trapped in a non-place. This folklore is unique to the digital age, blending physical environment with psychological disorientation.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="category-wp-content">
<figure class="wp-block-uagb-image__figure"><img decoding="async" src="/media-images/posts/the-backrooms-explained-illustration-1.webp" alt="Illustration for 2. Liminal Spaces & Modern Isolation" class="uag-image-1345" width="1200" height="450" title="2. Liminal Spaces & Modern Isolation" loading="lazy" role="img"></figure>
</section>





        


<div class="dossier-faq">
    <h2 class="dossier-faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="dossier-faq-list">

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: What are the Backrooms?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> A fictional liminal dimension</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Why is liminality scary?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Lack of context/purpose</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Is it a creepypasta?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Yes, originating on 4chan</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Real-life liminal spaces?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Empty airports, hotels</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Why popular now?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Reflects modern isolation</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
    </main>
        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
